  "instructions": [
    "heat oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.",
    "add onion and garlic and cook until onion is translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "add jalapeno pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add chicken and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "add broth, salt, black pepper, and oregano, and bring to a boil.",
    "reduce heat to medium-low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "add cherries and continue to simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "stir in cilantro and lime juice.",
    "serve stew hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
